# Creative Studio

Read `skills/creative-studio/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- Setup: `bash skills/creative-studio/scripts/bootstrap.sh` (venv on the PortableSSD; `--check`);
  prove it: `bash skills/creative-studio/scripts/selftest.sh`.
- Call: `bash skills/creative-studio/scripts/call.sh <tool> '<json>'` (or `@args.json`; `list`, `help <tool>`).
  Or register the MCP server — `skills/creative-studio/references/mcp-setup.md` (Cursor: `~/.cursor/mcp.json`).
- Order: brief → `brand_create` (user picks a concept) → assets with `brand=<slug>` and one
  `project=<name>` → LOOK at every preview and read warnings → deliver files + editable masters.
- Reels with captions: design at `ig_story` with `"leave_bottom": 0.26`; `captions.position: "bottom"`.
- Installs (`studio_install`, `comfyui_setup`, `mflux_setup`) and paid tools: dry run first, run only after the user's yes.
- Cinematic AI video with characters/dialogue → flow-studio-director. Real editing jobs → video-post-studio; motion graphics → motion-design-studio; stock → stock-library.
